```Title: Obfuscated PowerShell Execution (Base64 + IEX or Char Join) (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1027.010 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 6e81c18d-629d-487d-9023-82af41a1cfea```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Some legitimate deployment or management scripts```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(Image IN ("*\\powershell.exe", "*\\pwsh.exe") (CommandLine="*FromBase64String*" CommandLine IN ("*IEX*", "*Invoke-Expression*")) OR (CommandLine="*[char]*" CommandLine="*-join*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
